{"id":"wb-4-87","name":"妙湛寺金刚塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"妙湛寺金刚塔","text":"妙湛寺金刚塔位于云南省昆明市东南郊官渡古镇的妙湛寺前，因全塔由砂石砌成，又称妙湛寺石塔。该塔塔座呈方形，四面有券门相通，因此民间又称其为穿心塔。1956年，该文物被云南省人民委员会认定为第一批省级文物保护单位。1996年，它又被国务院列入第四批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A6%99%E6%B9%9B%E5%AF%BA%E9%87%91%E5%88%9A%E5%A1%94","revisionId":91526353,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91526353","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/5f8a42458321868b0b8b0411.jpg","title":"妙湛寺金刚塔_2025-09-17_22.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%A6%99%E6%B9%9B%E5%AF%BA%E9%87%91%E5%88%9A%E5%A1%94_2025-09-17_22.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5e/%E5%A6%99%E6%B9%9B%E5%AF%BA%E9%87%91%E5%88%9A%E5%A1%94_2025-09-17_22.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Kcx36","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​妙湛寺金刚塔 北面","width":320,"height":240}}